192 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 162 0 R/T(First, we created a virtual test environment where we simulate the sky, the moving beacon, stars, noise, turbulence and other unwanted lights.)/E(First, we created a virtual test environment where we simulate the sky, the moving beacon, stars, noise, turbulence and other unwanted lights.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

193 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 162 0 R/T(Second, we built the tracking system, which acts like the brain of the terminal. It receives the camera feed, finds the beacon, identifies whether it is the correct beacon, and continuously moves the virtual camera to keep it centered.)/E(Second, we built the tracking system, which acts like the brain of the terminal. It receives the camera feed, finds the beacon, identifies whether it is the correct beacon, and continuously moves the virtual camera to keep it centered.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

194 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 162 0 R/T(One important thing we use is the beacon's 4 Hz blinking pattern. So even if a star or another bright object is brighter than the beacon, our system can reject it because it doesn't have the same blinking pattern.)/E(One important thing we use is the beacon's 4 Hz blinking pattern. So even if a star or another bright object is brighter than the beacon, our system can reject it because it doesn't have the same blinking pattern.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

195 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 162 0 R/T(We also predict where the beacon will be a few milliseconds in the future, so that camera delay doesn't make us point behind the moving target.)/E(We also predict where the beacon will be a few milliseconds in the future, so that camera delay doesn't make us point behind the moving target.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

196 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 162 0 R/T(So, in simple words, ZeroDrift sees the beacon, confirms it is the right one, predicts where it is going, and keeps the camera pointed at it.)/E(So, in simple words, ZeroDrift sees the beacon, confirms it is the right one, predicts where it is going, and keeps the camera pointed at it.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

